 "description": "<p>Five pieces make this maid set read as a costume rather than a lingerie set: headgear, neck ring, bra, thong, and the apron that does the actual work of saying maid. Chiffon throughout, in the colorway shown.</p>\n<p>The apron is the anchor. Over a bra and thong it creates the servant silhouette from the front while leaving the back mostly bare - a structural trick heavier fabrics cannot pull off. The neck ring adds the formality that separates maid from generic lingerie, and the headgear finishes it.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon</li>\n<li>Includes: headgear, neck ring, bra, thong, apron</li>\n<li>Style: maid servant, midnight glamour</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sized 40-60 kg. Wear it as a complete costume or drop the headgear and neck ring for a simpler bedroom set.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Five-piece chiffon maid servant set with apron, headgear, neck ring, bra and thong, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
